/ A place on a map, built like the choropleth tooltips: the name in bold, then
/ what is known about it in small lines (.map-popup in application.sass). On
/ the map page and on a Stadtteil page.
/
/ location is the Location, documents the Drucksachen to name (loaded with
/ Document.for_list), total how many there are in all.
- quarters = location.quarters.filter_map { |name| Quarter.lookup(name) }
strong= location.name
- if quarters.any?
  .text-secondary
    = safe_join(quarters.map { |quarter| quarter.district ? link_to(quarter.name, quarter_path(district: quarter.district, quarter: quarter.slug)) : quarter.name }, ', ')
    - districts = quarters.filter_map(&:district).uniq.map(&:name)
    - if districts.any?
      = " · #{districts.join(', ')}"

ul.map-popup-documents
  - documents.each do |document|
    - agenda_item = document.latest_agenda_item
    li
      = link_to document_title(document), document_path(document, district: document.district)
      .text-secondary
        = document.number
        - if agenda_item
          - if (decision = decision_label(agenda_item))
            = ' · '
            = decision
          = " · #{l agenda_item.meeting.date}"

- if total > documents.size
  .text-secondary.mb-1= "und #{number_with_delimiter(total - documents.size)} weitere"
= link_to 'Alle Drucksachen zu diesem Ort', location_path(location, district: location.district)
